A||||13||Fformula88||Idiot drivers who cause you harm must be stopped!||||1||
Z||000000||Fformula88||01-13-2001||07:38 PM||||People who cannot drive their cars should be removed from the highway!  This afternoon, this idiot in a Taurus station wagon goes by me in the left lane on the thruway, heading into a corner.  Welkl, he comes up quickly on a car in front of him in the lane and lays on the brakes to slow down.  Well, long story short he spins out and goes sideways across MY lane.  Although he was far enough ahead of me so I could slow down, I couldn't stop and there was no place for me to swerve.  I hit him square right where the front and back doors meet with my dads 87 coupe!  At least Fiero's are tough customers!  Luckily no one was hurt, but its got the front end of Fiero totally messed up.  Front fascia is mangled a bit and pushed back.  Hood is cracked and it caused some damage to the headlight frame on the passenger side.  Luckily the motor is fine.  The car is driveable, but it cut a wire in the running lights which shorted them out.  HE must have been on the phone or something  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">  What a jerk.  There is one good thing... the Fiero despite being a bit worse for wear visually, is overall still ok.  Perfectly driveable anyway.  Its going for repair estimates to make sure the frame is good on Monday.  I am sure there is some damage, you can see it from inside the hood.  But his Taurus was pusghed in at least two feet!  That thing has got to be totalled (it is a 93).  I could not believe the damage the little Fiero inflicted!  Sorry for the long post, but Ijust had to vent.  Peace.<P>------------------<BR>John<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/formula2m6/FIEROSIG1.JPG">    <BR>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1997 Ford Probe SE<BR>AOL IM: Fformula88||||reg||1
Z||000001||2xsess||01-13-2001||08:10 PM||||Damn man, sorry to hear about that. Hopefully soon the mighty little Fiero will be fixed though.<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>AOL IM : Only2xsess<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/My_car_(large)sig_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
