Z||000004||Sillhouette.com||01-13-2001||09:49 PM||||I have always been an advocate of yearly driving tests for everyone over 40 years old.  Two year driving test for everyone between 20 - 40.  We do this in the aviation world why should not we do it in the driving world.  I have to have a flight test every six months and that is only one licence. I have four that have to be kept current not including my medical.  <BR>I guarantee there would be less bad drivers..<P>Later||||reg||1
Z||000005||Scott_M||01-13-2001||11:29 PM||||I almost got nailed myself today. I was at a light waiting to go left onto the on ramp to the Northbound 405. It's got two lanes and I was on the outside. So the light turns and we all move forward to turn left when half way through the turn the IDIOT on the inside takes his turn TOO WIDE, right in to my lane. Like he didn't even see me. Of course I'm honking my horn, and screaming at him that there are TWO lanes. And he isn't the only one on the road. Of course all I get back is the "deer in headlights" look. IDIOTS!!!!    Sorry for the long post. But I had to vent. ||||reg||14
