Z||000011||rogergarrison||01-14-2001||02:05 PM||||dont think anythings gonna happen to idiot drivers for a long time. Id support any politician whod want retest everyear or 4 years (ohio renewal). Not just older people, Ive been cut off and everything by every age. its just a driver thing-get a licence and everyone pretty much says get outta my way i got somewhere to go. <P>Ive had my private pilot licence for over 20 years. Flew F-4D,C during late 60's and early 70's, talk about speed-how bout 1200MPH above treetops. I drive almost everywhere I go now, just enjoy it. Have a 1977 Cessna XP.||||reg||1
